WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:02.097
- How do you say the word G-I-F?

00:00:02.097 --> 00:00:03.358
- I say JIF.

00:00:03.358 --> 00:00:05.127
- G-I-F you pronounce JIF?

00:00:05.127 --> 00:00:06.215
- Yes.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:08.769
- This is the wrongest
thing that a person can do.

00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:13.041
(lighthearted music)

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:15.780
- I say GIF. Some people say
JIF, like a bunch of dummies.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.840
- Yeah, JIF, it's not Jiffy peanut butter.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.401
- JIF, yeah, I call it a JIF.

00:00:20.401 --> 00:00:22.599
- Like I, wait, you would call it a JIF?

00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:24.875
- No, it's GIF. If you say it
any other way, you're wrong.

00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:27.964
- I've heard, like, computer
people say JIF before.

00:00:27.964 --> 00:00:30.888
- It's kind of like gift,
it's just missing the T.

00:00:30.888 --> 00:00:33.273
- But like, is GIF short for something?

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.458
- GIF, Graphics Interchange
Format. That makes sense.

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.176
- Nobody says jraphics.

00:00:40.176 --> 00:00:42.219
- Graphics is a hard G.

00:00:42.219 --> 00:00:43.891
- So many words are not pronounced the way

00:00:43.891 --> 00:00:45.168
they're supposed to be.
- Which is fine,

00:00:45.168 --> 00:00:47.903
but this word should be pronounced GIF.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:51.043
- Then you should've used a J.

00:00:51.043 --> 00:00:52.994
- If you coin an abbreviation,

00:00:52.994 --> 00:00:55.014
you don't get to coin how it's pronounced.

00:00:55.014 --> 00:00:57.754
- JIF is fine, but it doesn't seem right.

00:00:57.754 --> 00:01:00.098
- I'm just gonna call JPEGs GPEGs now.

00:01:00.098 --> 00:01:01.677
- People can say GIF, people can say JIF,

00:01:01.677 --> 00:01:03.605
people can say GEEF,
or whatever they want.

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:04.487
- GEEF.

00:01:04.487 --> 00:01:06.043
- I mean, I don't care what people do.

00:01:06.043 --> 00:01:08.086
- Let us know in the
comments what you think.

00:01:08.086 --> 00:01:11.033
- Well, here I say GIF, and so.

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.439
- In private, in Kenny's bedroom.

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:13.439
- And here's the only place I use Giphy.

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:16.120
I like whisper it to myself
after I talk to somebody.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:16.770
(laughs)

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.068
At my desk, I'm like, "Oh
yeah, did you see that GIF?

00:01:19.068 --> 00:01:19.928
"That was really good."

00:01:19.928 --> 00:01:21.344
Then it's like, "JIF."

